WEBVTT

00:00:00.053 --> 00:00:02.526
You need to answer every question in this short

00:00:02.553 --> 00:00:05.894
check correctly You have up to three tries per

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:10.026
question and two quiz attempts If both quiz attempts

00:00:10.092 --> 00:00:13.289
are unsuccessful you will review the teaching and have

00:00:13.355 --> 00:00:17.934
two final quiz attempts If these are also unsuccessful

00:00:18.289 --> 00:00:22.579
you may continue on an attendance-only route A certificate

00:00:22.618 --> 00:00:25.329
of attendance does not confirm that you passed
